WEBVTT

00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:14.780
And in the end, it finally appears in front of us…!

00:00:17.950 --> 00:00:20.160
What a ridiculously large Monster!

00:00:23.080 --> 00:00:27.340
This Dyson Sphere is a space fortress
 capable of engulfing the sun.

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.380
That ability is unmatchable!

00:00:30.300 --> 00:00:33.130
Kaito, all of your attacks will be useless!

00:00:33.470 --> 00:00:36.640
Impossible...! You're saying I can't attack it?

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:41.560
That is right. When Dyson Sphere has Overlay Units attached to it,

00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.810
it is able to negate all of my opponent's attacks.

00:00:45.770 --> 00:00:48.400
So that's why my attack didn't go through?

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:50.530
But now I know its effect!

00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:52.360
Don't be so sure of that.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.370
I know exactly what you are thinking.

00:00:58.030 --> 00:01:00.290
Because the one who taught you how to Duel...

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:02.750
...was me, after all.

00:01:05.870 --> 00:01:07.580
V was Kaito's teacher?!

00:01:16.630 --> 00:01:20.310
When Tron... No, when my father went missing...

00:01:20.560 --> 00:01:22.600
...my family was split apart.

00:01:23.560 --> 00:01:25.850
My younger brothers were taken
 to an orphanage as such a young age.

00:01:26.480 --> 00:01:30.400
In order to investigate the truth behind my father's disappearance,

00:01:30.570 --> 00:01:32.570
I stayed with Dr. Faker.

00:01:35.450 --> 00:01:39.320
And that is when I met you brothers.

00:01:40.740 --> 00:01:42.540
When I watched you brothers...

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:47.170
I may have very well saw myself and my brothers in you.

00:01:50.960 --> 00:01:53.550
And you wished to be stronger.

00:01:53.550 --> 00:01:56.880
You wanted to acquire the power to protect your brother.

00:01:57.840 --> 00:02:00.970
Thus, I taught you about Dueling.

00:02:04.470 --> 00:02:07.600
However, I never expected that I would battle you again in this manner.

00:02:07.600 --> 00:02:10.270
But if you are trying to get in my way,

00:02:10.980 --> 00:02:12.360
I will not show you any mercy!

00:02:16.150 --> 00:02:17.450
Kaito…

00:02:18.660 --> 00:02:23.700
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:02:23.990 --> 00:02:29.040
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:02:41.930 --> 00:02:45.890
<i>Hey, my friends, what scenery do you suppose</i>

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:51.690
<i>awaits us on the other side of this hill?</i>

00:02:52.480 --> 00:02:56.320
<i>Hey, my friends, let's climb it together</i>

00:02:57.650 --> 00:03:02.320
<i>It's too late for us to turn back now</i>

00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:07.410
<i>The time has come to combine
 together the power dwelling inside me</i>

00:03:08.160 --> 00:03:12.960
<i>Gotta release my Soul Drive</i>

00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:18.800
<i>Advance, advance, beyond the limits of your strength</i>

00:03:19.010 --> 00:03:23.800
<i>Come along with me and burn our flame of life</i>

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:29.270
<i>Keep running, keep running, until you get there</i>

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:34.940
<i>Once again, once again, keep those challenges coming</i>

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:41.110
<i>My friends, keep on living in the here and now</i>

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:47.200
<i>Keep pressing onward together no matter what happens</i>

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:51.370
I set one card and end my turn!

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:54.130
My turn. Draw!

00:03:54.250 --> 00:03:58.880
"Number 56: The Great Decisive Battle of Outer Space!
 Neo Galaxy-Eyes Strikes Back"

00:03:54.750 --> 00:03:55.710
I know...

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.920
What you are thinking.

00:03:58.460 --> 00:04:01.220
Dyson Sphere's Attack Power is 2800.

00:04:01.630 --> 00:04:04.720
However, Galaxy-Eyes' Attack Power is 3000.

00:04:05.340 --> 00:04:07.640
Therefore, you think I won’t declare an attack, right?

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:13.810
But it seems you still aren't completely aware of Dyson Sphere’s second ability!

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:15.770
Second ability?!

00:04:16.230 --> 00:04:18.570
I activate Dyson Sphere's effect!

00:04:19.230 --> 00:04:23.740
By detaching one Overlay Unit, it can attack directly!

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:27.700
What?!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:30.830
A direct attack with 2800 Attack Points?!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:33.000
If that attack connects… Kaito will…!

00:04:33.080 --> 00:04:34.170
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.880
Trap, activate! Photonize!

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:48.970
When there is a Light-Attribute Monster on my field,

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:51.100
my opponent’s attack is negated,

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:55.980
and my Light Monster’s Attack Power will increase equal to the Attack Power of my opponent’s attacking Monster!

00:04:58.110 --> 00:05:00.690
So he utilized the opponent’s direct attack to his own advantage.

00:05:01.110 --> 00:05:04.860
It’s useless. I have already foreseen your Dueling.

00:05:05.400 --> 00:05:07.950
Trap, activate! Space Gate!

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:08.870
What?!

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:14.830
When there is a Dyson Sphere on the field, it can negate the activation of my opponent’s Trap Card and destroy it!

00:05:20.590 --> 00:05:22.260
Take it, Kaito!

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:26.970
The pain I suffered from Dr. Faker, and my grudge against him for tearing my family apart!

00:05:30.010 --> 00:05:30.810
Kaito!

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:35.810
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:05:36.390 --> 00:05:39.560
I can’t believe that Kaito… is being beaten this badly!

00:05:45.820 --> 00:05:47.110
This man's Dueling...

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:49.780
...is scarily flawless!

00:05:51.240 --> 00:05:53.700
You only have 200 of your Life remaining.

00:05:54.540 --> 00:05:56.500
This match has already been decided.

00:05:57.160 --> 00:05:58.500
Give up, Kaito.

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:00.920
You cannot defeat me!

00:06:02.300 --> 00:06:04.130
Stand up, Kaito!

00:06:05.420 --> 00:06:09.300
If you collapse over here, what will happen to Haruto?

00:06:09.760 --> 00:06:10.510
Haruto...

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:15.470
Kaito!

00:06:16.230 --> 00:06:16.890
Shut up!

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.650
I don’t need your sympathy!

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:20.560
Wha...?!

00:06:20.860 --> 00:06:23.070
That’s right! Shut your mouth, Foolma!

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:27.320
What the heck?! Yuma may be an idiot, but he isn't some foolish pig!

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:27.320
Note: Tonma is an Asian pun used to call someone an idiot. It comes from the word "ton", which means pig.

00:06:27.320 --> 00:06:27.860
Eh?!

00:06:28.030 --> 00:06:28.990
Look, you...

00:06:29.660 --> 00:06:33.410
How surprising, Yuma, that you actually treat Kaito as an ally.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:38.620
Kaito is the son of Dr. Faker, the one who betrayed Kazuma-<i>san</i>!

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.040
And most importantly, he is a Numbers Hunter!

00:06:41.460 --> 00:06:43.290
If Kaito survives, then that means…

00:06:44.170 --> 00:06:46.590
One day you will be hunted by him as well!

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:50.640
Of course I know that!

00:06:51.510 --> 00:06:53.390
But I once had a Duel with Kaito.

00:06:54.310 --> 00:06:57.890
Therefore, no matter how he thinks, he is my friend!

00:06:58.310 --> 00:07:00.940
And my goal too!

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:02.860
Friend, you say?

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:05.730
Kazuma-<i>san</i> did treasure that as well.

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:10.780
But, that ideal was completely wrecked and betrayed by Dr. Faker!

00:07:11.320 --> 00:07:14.620
Can you forgive...that kind of person’s son?!

00:07:16.790 --> 00:07:20.250
When I realized all of the truth, I…

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:25.130
<i>Chris!</i>

00:07:26.210 --> 00:07:28.130
<i>Please wait! Wait!</i>

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:31.010
<i>Where are you... Where are you going?</i>

00:07:34.550 --> 00:07:35.350
<i>Chris!</i>

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:47.650
<i>Chris...</i>

00:07:51.490 --> 00:07:52.860
Enough of this nonsense!

00:07:53.410 --> 00:07:56.330
I will defeat you and recover your Number!

00:07:57.080 --> 00:08:00.580
In the end, you do not understand our hatred in the least, it seems.

00:08:00.870 --> 00:08:04.080
Shut up! My turn! Draw!

00:08:05.880 --> 00:08:07.000
<i>Dyson Sphere...</i>

00:08:08.550 --> 00:08:11.050
It can negate attacks, and is able to attack directly!

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:14.010
Although at first glance that effect seems invincible...

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:16.470
But there is a way.

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:19.390
I see it! Dyson Sphere’s weakness!

00:08:19.810 --> 00:08:22.890
I activate the Magic Card, Overlay Break!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:27.270
This card can send all Overlay Units to the Graveyard,

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.610
and that Monster now changes to “can be destroyed by battle”!

00:08:31.070 --> 00:08:32.320
I expected no less from Kaito.

00:08:32.950 --> 00:08:35.280
Huh? What? What happened?

00:08:36.200 --> 00:08:40.910
Dyson Sphere can only negate battles when it has Overlay Units.

00:08:44.960 --> 00:08:47.330
Because of Kaito’s Magic card,

00:08:47.710 --> 00:08:50.210
Dyson Sphere’s invincible effect is negated.

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:56.140
Plus, even the effect of “only Numbers can be destroy Numbers” is negated too!

00:08:56.470 --> 00:08:58.140
I-I get it!

00:08:58.350 --> 00:09:00.930
Now Dyson Sphere has become a huge pile of scrap!

00:09:01.350 --> 00:09:04.270
Go, Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:09:04.600 --> 00:09:06.520
Photon Stream of Destruction!

00:09:07.270 --> 00:09:09.400
I already expect that move as well.

00:09:09.940 --> 00:09:13.070
I activate another effect of Dyson Sphere!

00:09:13.400 --> 00:09:14.150
What?!

00:09:14.240 --> 00:09:18.120
When Dyson Sphere is attacked while it has no Overlay Units,

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:20.990
it can recover Overlay Units from Graveyard!

00:09:23.370 --> 00:09:26.460
At this moment, I activate Dyson Sphere’s first effect!

00:09:26.960 --> 00:09:31.130
When it has Overlay Units, my opponent’s attack will be negated!

00:09:37.720 --> 00:09:39.140
It’s futile, Kaito.

00:09:39.350 --> 00:09:42.770
No one is capable off destroying Dyson Sphere!

00:09:44.640 --> 00:09:46.730
Kaito's Life has fallen to 200.

00:09:47.230 --> 00:09:48.940
When next turn comes…

00:09:50.520 --> 00:09:51.320
I...

00:09:52.690 --> 00:09:56.030
...set one card and end my turn.

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.070
My turn. Draw!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:01.990
It's coming...!

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:03.330
A direct attack!

00:10:04.580 --> 00:10:08.080
I activate the Equipment Magic, Gravity Blaster!

00:10:08.710 --> 00:10:09.420
What?!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:15.710
Once per turn, this card can increase equipped Monster’s Attack Power by 400,

00:10:16.130 --> 00:10:19.340
plus it can negate my the opponent's Monster’s effects!

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:23.390
Why didn't he attack directly?!

00:10:23.600 --> 00:10:25.390
Why would V do that?

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.400
Kaito, you should know the reason.

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:31.900
Mere victory won't be enough.

00:10:32.610 --> 00:10:37.950
My true victory will only determined when I crush Galaxy-Eyes , your embodiment!

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:42.320
Get moving, Dyson Sphere!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:50.880
Galaxy-Eyes!

00:10:50.960 --> 00:10:51.710
Kaito!

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:57.050
Trap, activate! Mirror Shade!

00:10:57.420 --> 00:11:02.510
By halving my Life, this card can negate the damage I received!

00:11:07.350 --> 00:11:08.480
Kaito-<i>sama</i>!

00:11:13.650 --> 00:11:15.650
It's impossible! There is no way he can win this!

00:11:15.770 --> 00:11:18.610
Kai…Kaito…is going to lose?

00:11:19.280 --> 00:11:20.910
Kaito's Life is 100.

00:11:21.410 --> 00:11:23.030
V's Life remains untouched.

00:11:23.740 --> 00:11:26.120
Even for Kaito, under these circumstances…

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:30.120
Kaito, it's very painful, isn't it?
 Unbearable, isn't it?

00:11:30.870 --> 00:11:32.080
But that's enough already.

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:37.420
With this, you can release yourself from all kinds of suffering.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:42.260
Whether it's the mission as a Numbers Hunter, or the pain brought by Haruto…

00:11:45.050 --> 00:11:48.720
This is the final act of pity I can give you.

00:11:50.060 --> 00:11:50.980
You're wrong...

00:11:55.770 --> 00:11:58.860
Until now, not even for a single moment...

00:12:00.280 --> 00:12:03.740
...did I ever consider Haruto as my pain!

00:12:06.030 --> 00:12:09.160
He's… Haruto is my everything!

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:10.870
He's my reason for living!

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:14.790
Kaito...

00:12:15.920 --> 00:12:19.460
He has always given me hope!

00:12:21.340 --> 00:12:22.550
I won’t give up.

00:12:23.260 --> 00:12:25.550
Not on myself or on Haruto!

00:12:26.220 --> 00:12:28.680
Very well. Come at me!

00:12:29.180 --> 00:12:31.180
My turn. Draw!

00:12:33.810 --> 00:12:36.980
<i>This is...! This card is...!</i>

00:12:40.070 --> 00:12:41.400
<i>This card will...</i>

00:12:43.320 --> 00:12:44.860
<i>...save me?!</i>

00:12:46.370 --> 00:12:47.320
<i>Haruto...</i>

00:12:49.660 --> 00:12:51.160
This is my fate...

00:12:52.000 --> 00:12:52.660
I...

00:12:53.660 --> 00:12:56.420
...activate the Magic Card, Feelings Towards the Future!

00:12:58.290 --> 00:13:00.840
What?! What’s that card?!

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:04.880
I…I can’t believe you have a card I don't know!

00:13:07.300 --> 00:13:08.600
A card like that...

00:13:10.010 --> 00:13:11.810
...was in your deck?

00:13:13.020 --> 00:13:15.390
Regardless of how much you may know about me,

00:13:15.770 --> 00:13:18.020
there's no way you can know about this card.

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:24.950
Because this card is the only one in my life my father gave me!

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:29.990
Kaito’s father…Dr. Faker gave him that?

00:13:30.830 --> 00:13:34.870
Until now, I haven’t used this card even once.

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.040
Absurd... You hate your father so much...

00:13:38.540 --> 00:13:41.000
And yet you put that card in your deck?!

00:13:41.630 --> 00:13:43.380
Why would you ever do something like that?!

00:13:43.760 --> 00:13:44.880
It's obvious!

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.840
It's obvious, isn't it?!

00:13:48.680 --> 00:13:50.220
Anyone would want to protect their family, no matter who they are!

00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:53.430
Just like you guys wish to protect your own family!

00:13:54.480 --> 00:13:57.100
That’s why Kaito will always hold that card,

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:00.690
because he has hope for his own family!

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:04.280
Hope for his family?

00:14:05.030 --> 00:14:06.150
That's why Kaito-

00:14:06.150 --> 00:14:06.740
Shut up!

00:14:08.780 --> 00:14:12.200
I don’t need you to speak for my heart.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.330
Magic card, Feelings Towards the Future!

00:14:15.870 --> 00:14:20.170
This card can Summon three Monsters with different levels from my Graveyard!

00:14:20.830 --> 00:14:24.050
Revive, Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:14:24.630 --> 00:14:28.220
And Photon Slasher! Photon Pirate!

00:14:29.840 --> 00:14:34.350
But Monsters Special Summoned by this effect will have their Attack Power changed to zero!

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:37.810
It’s meaningless, Kaito! Their Attack Points are zero!

00:14:38.350 --> 00:14:41.110
Plus, they're different levels. What good can they do?

00:14:41.690 --> 00:14:43.150
Is that really the case?

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:44.230
What?

00:14:44.980 --> 00:14:47.570
I activate the Magic Card, Shift Down!

00:14:48.400 --> 00:14:51.570
This card can change all levels of Monsters on my field,

00:14:52.160 --> 00:14:54.410
all to be the same of the Monster with highest level!

00:14:54.580 --> 00:14:57.620
I raise all Monsters’ Level to eight!

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.420
What?!

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:08.380
I Overlay the Level Eight Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon, Photon Slasher, and Photon Pirate!

00:15:12.340 --> 00:15:15.260
I use these three Monsters to build the Overlay Network!

00:15:15.810 --> 00:15:17.020
Xyz Summon!

00:15:18.770 --> 00:15:20.310
Great Galaxy of Reversal!

00:15:21.600 --> 00:15:25.480
Become the rolling waves of light and show your mighty form!

00:15:30.860 --> 00:15:33.280
Descend, my very soul!

00:15:34.070 --> 00:15:36.790
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:15:50.170 --> 00:15:54.260
At this moment, I activate the effect of Field Magic, Cosmic Frontier!

00:15:54.970 --> 00:15:59.270
When I Xyz summon successfully, I can draw one card!

00:16:01.230 --> 00:16:01.850
It's here!

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:04.810
I activate Neo Galaxy Eyes' effect!

00:16:05.860 --> 00:16:07.190
Photon Howling!

00:16:12.110 --> 00:16:14.780
When Neo Galaxy-Eyes is Xyz Summoned successfully,

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:18.830
it can negate effects of all Monsters except of itself!

00:16:24.120 --> 00:16:25.630
Dyson Sphere is...!

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:34.010
I activate the Magic Card, Big Bang Panic!

00:16:35.340 --> 00:16:39.470
This card changes all face-up Magic or Trap Cards on my opponent’s field

00:16:39.520 --> 00:16:42.060
to my opponent's Monster’s Overlay Units!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:50.440
And with every additional Overlay Unit, my Monster gains 800 Attack Points!

00:16:55.780 --> 00:17:00.950
And by detaching one Overlay Unit, I activate the effect of Neo Galaxy-Eyes!

00:17:01.580 --> 00:17:04.540
It absorbs all Overlay Units from Dyson Sphere!

00:17:08.960 --> 00:17:13.220
For Every Overlay Unit absorbed, it gains 500 Attack Points!

00:17:14.420 --> 00:17:16.430
It's got 6800 Attack Points?!

00:17:17.050 --> 00:17:22.850
And Neo Galaxy-Eyes can attack up to the Number of Overlay Units it absorbed!

00:17:24.640 --> 00:17:27.600
Ever since that moment, somewhere deep within my heart,

00:17:28.190 --> 00:17:29.820
I was chasing you all along.

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.150
And now, finally...

00:17:36.110 --> 00:17:38.320
Neo Galaxy-Eyes Photon Dragon!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:41.740
Ultimate Photon Stream!!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:37.260
Kaito, so is this your strength?

00:19:03.080 --> 00:19:05.990
After revenge, only emptiness remains.

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:09.500
I am aware of that fact.

00:19:11.080 --> 00:19:15.340
V, no, Christopher Arklight.

00:19:16.090 --> 00:19:18.920
It’s been a long time since someone used that name to address me.

00:19:19.930 --> 00:19:21.970
So that's V’s real name?

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:26.220
Together with my father, I have given up my family’s name.

00:19:27.680 --> 00:19:30.850
Kaito, I did try to save my father.

00:19:31.690 --> 00:19:34.690
But when my father returned from the Parallel Worlds,

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:38.240
his heart was already consumed by vengeance towards Dr. Faker.

00:19:39.530 --> 00:19:41.950
I wasn't able to stop him.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:46.330
Nevertheless, I guess that is what “parental relationship” is all about.

00:19:47.240 --> 00:19:48.040
You're wrong.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:52.790
I fight because I resist my father.

00:19:53.500 --> 00:19:55.540
One day when I manage to resolve Haruto’s case,

00:19:56.000 --> 00:19:59.210
I will settle the score with Dr. Faker using my own hands!

00:20:00.050 --> 00:20:00.920
Kaito...

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:05.470
I see. So you have already become this strong, huh?

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:10.890
Chris, I will inherit your feelings.

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:14.020
And I will settle the score with Tron in your place!

00:20:14.650 --> 00:20:15.480
Kaito...

00:20:24.570 --> 00:20:27.240
You guys are indeed my…

00:20:28.030 --> 00:20:29.200
...little brothers.

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:35.460
Chris...

00:20:41.760 --> 00:20:42.380
Kaito.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.050
Yuma...

00:20:44.510 --> 00:20:48.350
Wait for me! I will definitely make it to the next stage!

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:51.980
Let's go, Orbital 7!

00:20:52.230 --> 00:20:53.980
U-Understood!

00:20:54.310 --> 00:20:57.480
Bu…But the glider is out of order.

00:20:58.480 --> 00:21:00.230
I-I just got stared down...

00:21:00.820 --> 00:21:02.030
U-Understood!

00:21:02.610 --> 00:21:04.320
Now I will undergo urgent operation!

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:08.490
Please wait for 3 seconds. 1…2…3!

00:21:30.600 --> 00:21:31.600
Let's...

00:21:32.930 --> 00:21:33.930
...sleep together.

00:21:39.150 --> 00:21:41.150
Tron and Dr. Faker...

00:21:41.860 --> 00:21:43.820
When two of them took action,

00:21:44.570 --> 00:21:46.740
I was transported to this world.

00:21:47.570 --> 00:21:51.700
Which means that was your father’s intention, who is in the Astral World currently.

00:21:52.740 --> 00:21:57.250
My father wished for me to stop Tron and Dr. Faker, together with you.

00:21:59.040 --> 00:21:59.790
Yuma.

00:22:00.210 --> 00:22:00.920
Right!

00:22:01.420 --> 00:22:03.460
I'll do it! I'll do this!

00:22:04.050 --> 00:22:08.010
I will give those egocentric adults a lesson too!

00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:15.560
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:22:15.810 --> 00:22:21.190
<i>Move on ahead, speeding up our throbbing beats</i>

00:22:26.820 --> 00:22:31.870
<i>Listen boys and girls, here's the secret to boys and girls like you</i>

00:22:32.240 --> 00:22:36.160
<i>You're really just so spontaneous, wild as can be</i>

00:22:36.160 --> 00:22:37.410
<i>I bet you didn't know?</i>

00:22:37.660 --> 00:22:40.130
<i>You might be a handful, but what's wrong with that?</i>

00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:42.750
<i>Be up to no good, but learn for real</i>

00:22:42.920 --> 00:22:47.970
<i>Go the unpredictable route and shuffle your cards with a goal in mind</i>

00:22:48.130 --> 00:22:53.310
<i>Whenever you feel like you've lost your way, just take a minute to close your eyes...</i>

00:22:53.430 --> 00:22:58.940
<i>Shout "stop!" with all you've got, and there's your boundary line.</i>

00:23:00.310 --> 00:23:05.440
<i>We stand tall, until we have victory in our grasp</i>

00:23:05.610 --> 00:23:10.910
<i>We won't just stop here, not when we don't want to have any regrets.</i>

00:23:11.070 --> 00:23:16.200
<i>Even if we get hurt, we can't just hesitate now</i>

00:23:16.410 --> 00:23:21.790
<i>We won't just give up, not when our future's a lot brighter than our today</i>

00:23:21.790 --> 00:23:27.010
<i>Seriousness... It'll only make us keep fighting even harder</i>

00:23:27.210 --> 00:23:32.550
<i>We'll always get as fascinated as we want, and we'll fight on every day</i>

00:23:41.020 --> 00:23:45.400
On the scorching Magma Field, the Duel between Shark and IV has finally started!

00:23:45.400 --> 00:23:50.280
The shocking truths revealed by IV, plus Tron’s sudden appearance…

00:23:50.280 --> 00:23:53.070
On this field, his Monsters…

00:23:53.070 --> 00:23:55.240
I can’t believe you would give Numbers to…

00:23:55.240 --> 00:23:57.370
He can attack eight times in a row?!

00:23:57.370 --> 00:24:00.460
Dueling isn't a tool for rage and revenge!

00:24:01.460 --> 00:24:02.960
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ZeXal!

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:05.840
"Shark Torpedoed! The Nightmarish Fanservice"

00:24:06.250 --> 00:24:07.550
Hey, Shark!

00:24:07.550 --> 00:24:08.710
Shark!

00:24:10.340 --> 00:24:13.470
That was awesome how you beat Dyson Sphere, Kaito!

00:24:14.090 --> 00:24:18.180
But that means Kaito will use Dyson Sphere when we fight him next.

00:24:18.180 --> 00:24:20.430
Kaito is truly our greatest enemy.

00:24:20.430 --> 00:24:21.940
I ain't gonna lose!

00:24:22.350 --> 00:24:24.150
I'm gonna bring it to 'im!
